# Development Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env.development to customize your local development environment.
#
# NOTE: the app currently reads NO custom environment variables at runtime.
# Development toggles live in in-app Settings instead:
#   - Mock DNS responses  -> Settings > enableMockDNS (src/context/settingsStorage.ts)
#   - DNS server selection -> Settings > dnsServer (src/context/settingsStorage.ts)
#   - Verbose DNS logging  -> __DEV__ builds log via src/utils/devLog.ts
#
# Add variables here ONLY when code actually consumes them, and document the
# consuming module next to each entry.
